  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.header": "Processing uranium with a Centrifuge",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.text_1": "The Centrifuge is a kinetic machine for refining uranium.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.text_2": "It accepts rotational power through the rear shaft.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.text_3": "Right-click with Raw Uranium or Uranium to insert one item.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.text_4": "At 16 RPM or faster, uranium is enriched continuously until it reaches the target set on the scroll dial.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.centrifuge.text_5": "Extract finished uranium from the bottom, or right-click with an empty hand.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.header": "Assembling a Fusion Reactor",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_1": "Place the Fusion Reactor Core at the centre.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_10": "Right-click the core to form the reactor.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_2": "Use Accelerator Corners on all four corners.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_3": "Build an odd square ring: 5x5 to 11x11.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_4": "Fill the chamber between ring and core with Cryostat Casing.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_5": "More Electromagnets improve field stability.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_6": "Power a Magnet Drive with Create rotation.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_7": "Add an INPUT Fusion Fluid Port for coolant.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_8": "Add an OUTPUT Fusion Fluid Port for plasma steam.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_controller.text_9": "The Fuel Injector loads D-T Fuel Pellets.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.header": "Generating power with a Plasma Turbine",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_1": "The Plasma Turbine is a multiblock: start with a Fusion Turbine Casing.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_2": "Place a Fusion Turbine Rotor in line with the casing.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_3": "Cap the line with the Plasma Turbine, facing outward toward the shaft.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_4": "Feed plasma steam through a Fusion Turbine Fluid Port set to INPUT.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_5": "Drain condensate through another Fusion Turbine Fluid Port set to OUTPUT.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.fusion_plasma_turbine.text_6": "Each input/output pair can consume 160 mB/t and generate up to 4096 SU at 64 RPM.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.header": "Assembling a Nuclear Reactor",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_1": "The reactor is a multiblock: raise a hollow shell of Reactor Casing.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_10": "Leave the casing OPEN above every Control Rod column: rods are moved from up here.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_11": "Right-click the controller to form the reactor.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_12": "A Mechanical Piston above an open channel raises and lowers the Control Rods.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_13": "Super Glue the rods to each other and to the piston head so they move as one.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_14": "Withdrawn rods absorb fewer neutrons: the chain reaction and the heat ramp up.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_15": "Inserted rods soak up neutrons: the deeper they sit, the more the reaction is throttled. Fully inserted means shutdown.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_2": "The width must be odd (3-9) and the height 4-12.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_3": "Inside, raise columns of Uranium Rods: the fuel.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_4": "A central column of Heat Exchangers carries the heat into the coolant.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_5": "Control Rods on the corners absorb neutrons: they are the reactor's brakes.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_6": "Swap wall casing for a Reactor Fluid Port set to INPUT for coolant...",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_7": "...and another set to OUTPUT for steam.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_8": "A Reactor Fuel Port loads uranium fuel and ejects depleted fuel.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.reactor_controller.text_9": "Cap the reactor and place the Reactor Controller at the centre of the top face.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.header": "Assembling a Steam Turbine",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_1": "The Steam Turbine turns steam into rotational power. Start with a Turbine Casing.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_2": "Place a Turbine Rotor in front of the casing, its axis along the line.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_3": "Cap the line with a Turbine Output facing outward: it generates the rotation for your machines.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_4": "Feed steam through a Turbine Fluid Port set to INPUT...",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_5": "...and drain the condensate through another set to OUTPUT.",
  "create_nuclearindustry.ponder.turbine.text_6": "With steam flowing, the turbine forms on its own and the output shaft powers your contraptions.",
